    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The voice of one agent (protocol v27): the TTS model, the base identity, the speech-pipeline settings and the named delivery modes. Every speaking node of the agent (Speak, Generate And Speak) uses it. Hand-mirrors VoiceProfile in voice.fbs; ToWire converts it for CreateAgent / SetAgentVoice. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
